' UC-01 系统用例图
' 语义模型：参与者与用例的关联、用例间的包含与扩展关系。展示图 UC-01-系统用例图.png（docs/appendices/rendered） 按 UML 用例图惯例直排：
' 参与者分置系统边界两侧、用例两列排布、关系线用虚线标注 <<include>>／<<extend>>；修改关系时须同步重绘展示图。
' 本项目付款与交付在平台外完成，无外部系统或设备参与者。用例编号对应 docs/appendices/use-cases/index.md。
' Version: 0.3.1
' Version-Datetime: 2026-10-23T03:47:39+08:00
@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 22
skinparam ranksep 40
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

actor "R-01 校园用户" as A1
actor "R-02 买方" as A2
actor "R-03 卖方" as A3
actor "R-04 平台管理员" as A4

rectangle "校园二手交易与物品流转平台" {
  usecase "UC-C01 账户生命周期" as UC01
  usecase "UC-C03 检索商品" as UC03
  usecase "UC-C04 收藏与咨询" as UC04
  usecase "UC-C07 评价与举报" as UC07
  usecase "UC-C09 了解商品状态" as UC09
  usecase "UC-C11 接收通知与待办" as UC11
  usecase "UC-C12 管理本人业务" as UC12
  usecase "UC-C02 发布与维护商品" as UC02
  usecase "UC-C05 请求与确认交易" as UC05
  usecase "UC-C06 记录线下交付" as UC06
  usecase "UC-C08 审核与处置沟通" as UC08
  usecase "UC-C08-01 处置告知与申辩" as UC0801
  usecase "UC-C10 查看管理统计" as UC10
  usecase "UC-C13 维护商品分类" as UC13
  usecase "UC-C14 处理异常交易" as UC14
}

A1 --> UC01
A1 --> UC03
A1 --> UC04
A1 --> UC07
A1 --> UC09
A1 --> UC11
A1 --> UC12
A2 --> UC05
A2 --> UC06
A3 --> UC02
A3 --> UC05
A3 --> UC06
UC08 <-- A4
UC0801 <-- A4
A1 --> UC0801
UC02 <-- A4
UC10 <-- A4
UC13 <-- A4
UC14 <-- A4
UC06 ..> UC05 : <<extend>>\n有效约定后提交完成确认
UC0801 ..> UC08 : <<extend>>\n实际处置告知或用户说明／申辩
UC14 ..> UC05 : <<extend>>

@enduml
